{"game": "back-4-blood", "language": "schinese", "appid": 924970, "month": "2025-09", "window": 3, "start_date": 1757980800, "end_date": 1758671999, "month_true_total": 60, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 21:09:20 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "205029110", "author": {"steamid": "76561198979412239", "personaname": "Rush是关键", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198979412239/", "num_games_owned": 143, "num_reviews": 52, "playtime_forever": 6220, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 6220, "last_played": 1779947682, "avatar": "0247a04bd8a39899f9a0a40274812eb86f1b3889"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "求生之路我也玩，而且经常和朋友开黑，毫不避讳的说是多人协作PVE打丧尸的天花板作品，而喋血复仇是属于新的一页，所谓精神续作到底是官方宣传还是玩家意淫暂且不论，它是一款比较成功的作品，更多种类的突变体和更加具有压迫感的Boss！\n\n我觉得喋血复仇更加注重协作和配卡，早期的抽卡非常不科学，等有技能了一章也快打完了，然后就是游戏环境不好，配合不到位，就有人开始摆烂挂机要么就是引尸潮搞破坏，整友伤致死！\n\n如果喋血制作组未来能创建创意工坊可玩性又能大大提高了，但遗憾的是目前它已经停更了！", "timestamp_created": 1758635732, "timestamp_updated": 1787901806, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 29, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "205022090", "author": {"steamid": "76561198157339418", "personaname": "device", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/shendiyage/", "num_games_owned": 1027, "num_reviews": 108, "playtime_forever": 60, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 60, "last_played": 1719837504, "avatar": "fabe6b7e5c31137ea02db8f9d0c53752e7aff710"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "不开放创意工坊你就等死吧", "timestamp_created": 1758628062, "timestamp_updated": 1758628062, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "204922195", "author": {"steamid": "76561198985178051", "personaname": "ZeroTen010", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198985178051/", "num_games_owned": 2380, "num_reviews": 263, "playtime_forever": 13657, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 13649, "last_played": 1758511437, "avatar": "c8148e6efbf64fd70dd09fc77095cf5c60c93bfe"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "病毒肆虐的末世，拥有天然抗体的人便是上天派来的救世主，是这个崩坏的世界最后的希望\n这是一个很考验配合的游戏，团队合作是必不可少的，如果还按照玩其他游戏的个人主义打法，将会很难通过更高的难度，举几个例子，这游戏是有友伤设定的（无论是近战还是远程射击），难度越高，友伤的判定越高，每当尸潮来了，满屏的僵尸眼花缭乱的，不仔细分辨一下队友，还真有可能给他乱枪打死，还有一个设定是地图上刷新的金币堆是共享的，这意味着你拿到了这一堆，队友就只能去寻找其他的金币堆了，少拿的金币过多，到了下一关啥也买不起，就发育不起来，这就会造成一个现象，在资源贫瘠的前期，大家可能会为了早一步拿到金币而猛猛往前冲，让队伍拉得很长，一旦被尸潮围攻，掉队的队友倒下了，很难及时的去营救，就会引发一系列的不良反应，最终导致游戏失败，这个时候，配合的重要性就体现出来了\n这一代相较于以前的求生之路，多了一个比较创新的点，就是卡牌玩法，每个人在开局之前都可以搭配卡组，上限十五张卡，每张卡片都是对自己的一种buff增强，前期自己能用的卡比较少，用自带的新手卡组则会既没伤害也没回血还跑不动，大部分有用的卡都要通过完成战役关卡获取点数去补给线购买卡牌，从而搭配出更具有实战用途的卡组（去贴吧或者其他攻略区有很多大佬搭配好的卡组，各种打法的都有，可以直接照抄），目前版本来说最强的就是近战了（游戏更新已经完结了两年了，这个版本之子的头衔应该是永久的了），往那一站，谁也别想靠近我，手里的家伙不停挥舞，成为打不死的小强\n最后再说一下，本游戏自带小蓝熊反作弊系统，想要叮的一声就开始爽玩的小伙伴可能很难如愿了，不如叫上自己的小伙伴一起，冲锋陷阵，去享受四人成行的快乐吧(o゜▽゜)o☆", "timestamp_created": 1758511407, "timestamp_updated": 1758511407, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 8, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.582727670669555664", "comment_count": 2, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "204786870", "author": {"steamid": "76561199387528970", "personaname": "许小穆", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199387528970/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 3177, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3066, "last_played": 1758386453, "avatar": "e8834f1315ced75f7cd8c97a9ac5fa661bbc42e1"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "原价屎中屎，一折神中神\r\n", "timestamp_created": 1758379864, "timestamp_updated": 1758379864, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.545454561710357666", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "204780741", "author": {"steamid": "76561198320156923", "personaname": "柳智敏五女一", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Bayern0415/", "num_games_owned": 114, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 612, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 612, "last_played": 1635088390, "avatar": "1c31b766b5ed072238117513985479b83f328487"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "体量小。开放商跑路，关卡重复，怪物套娃，不推荐", "timestamp_created": 1758375050, "timestamp_updated": 1758375050, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}]}